<title>USA: PacifiCorp, ABB offer advice to deregulated.</title>
<headline>PacifiCorp, ABB offer advice to deregulated.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PacifiCorp said Monday it has formed EnergyPact with ABB Inc to help utilities and energy companies increase their competitiveness and prosper in a deregulated electric industry.</p>
<p>&quot;EnergyPact will offer an unprecedented menu of comprehensive energy products and services including upgrades to generating plant equipment, plant management services, fuel procurement services, risk management, energy trading and the considerable capital resources of both ABB and PacifiCorp,&quot; the company's statement said.</p>
</text>
